---
import '~/styles/siph-widgets.css';
---

<figure class="siph-widget" data-siph="neff">
  <div class="siph-widget__accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="siph-widget__head">
    <p class="siph-widget__kicker">示意图</p>
    <p class="siph-widget__title">neff 要落在氧化硅和硅之间</p>
  </div>
  <div class="siph-widget__controls">
    <button class="siph-widget__play" type="button" data-play aria-pressed="false">播放</button>
    <label class="siph-widget__slider">
      <span>neff</span>
      <input type="range" data-neff min="1.42" max="3.2" step="0.001" value="2.445347" />
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="siph-widget__snaps">
    <button type="button" data-snap="2.445347">TE0 · 2.445347</button>
    <button type="button" data-snap="1.771059">TM0 · 1.771059</button>
    <button type="button" data-snap="1.492897">第三个根 · 1.492897</button>
  </div>
  <div class="siph-widget__stage" data-stage>
    <canvas data-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="neff-axis">
    <div class="neff-axis__track" data-track>
      <div class="neff-axis__window" data-window></div>
      <div class="neff-axis__head" data-head></div>
    </div>
    <p class="neff-axis__note">浅色带从左端的氧化硅 1.44 到右端的硅 3.5。靠在左墙边上的那一点是丢掉的根，往右依次是 TM0 和 TE0。</p>
  </div>
  <p class="siph-widget__live" data-live aria-live="polite"></p>
  <p class="siph-widget__credit">Fierceman · fierceman26.github.io</p>
  <figcaption>
    拖动 neff，或点上面三个解。尾巴的长短按 1/√(neff² − 1.44²)，只用这个大约的包层折射率，不是另一次仿真。滑过的中间值不是这根 500 nm 条的导模。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<script>
  import { mountNeff } from './neff-view';

  function boot() {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-siph="neff"]').forEach((el) => mountNeff(el));
  }

  boot();
</script>
